incorrect request matcher json format for:

  {
      "pathParameters" : {
          "path_somePara meterName" : [ "path_someParameterValue" ]
      }
  }

 schema validation errors:

  8 errors:
   - $.anyOf: is missing but it is required
   - $.binaryData: is missing but it is required
   - $.dnsName: is missing but it is required
   - $.if: is missing but it is required
   - $.pathParameters.path_somePara meterName: is not defined in the schema and the schema does not allow additional properties
   - $.pathParameters: invalid parameter format, the following are valid examples: 

       {
           "exampleRegexParameter": [
               "^some +regex$"
           ], 
           "exampleNottedAndSimpleStringParameter": [
               "!notThisValue", 
               "simpleStringMatch"
           ]
       }

    or:

       {
           "exampleSchemaParameter": [
               {
                   "type": "number"
               }
           ], 
           "exampleMultiSchemaParameter": [
               {
                   "type": "string", 
                   "pattern": "^some +regex$"
               }, 
               {
                   "type": "string", 
                   "format": "ipv4"
               }
           ]
       }
   - $.pathParameters: should be valid to one and only one schema, but 0 are valid
   - $.specUrlOrPayload: is missing, but is required, if specifying OpenAPI request matcher

  OpenAPI Specification: https://app.swaggerhub.com/apis/jamesdbloom/mock-server-openapi/9.2.x
  Documentation: https://mock-server.com/mock_server/creating_expectations.html

